@startuml trust-boundaries
!include _style.iuml
title MemForge trust boundaries and controls

rectangle "**Memory content (untrusted input)**\nmemory files, MEMORY.md, rollups,\n.memforge/ as in the work tree\nSC-14 no-follow store reads and writes\nSC-15 frontmatter size and node limits\nSC-16 index fields untrusted\nSC-43 unreadable is reported, never absent\nSC-24 write gate (fails open, says so)" as Content #FEE2E2

rectangle "**Tools (run as the user)**\nmemforge, console scripts, hooks\nSC-05 repository-local git variables dropped\nSC-06 absolute PATH lookup, none in the store\nor its repository\nSC-10 SC-11 automatic commit scope\nSC-12 SC-13 hook message and path rules\nSC-17 SC-18 SC-19 recall and index filters\nSC-41 recall index is a checked local cache\nSC-42 control characters escaped in output\nSC-20 SC-21 export gate, DLP\nSC-22 SC-23 Tier 2 audit, waivers at HEAD\nSC-40 file names passed to git literally\nSC-25 SC-36 local-only dispatch\nSC-26 isolated detect helpers\nSC-32 SC-33 SC-34 SC-37 agents-md-gen" as Tools

rectangle "**Store repository**\nhistory, committed signer list,\nmemforge.verifiedHead\nSC-01 signature vs parent's list\nSC-02 unreleased modes refused\nSC-03 list grammar, 1 MiB cap\nSC-44 list reads bounded, blob only\nSC-04 list_removed\nSC-05 isolated verification\nSC-07 rewrite, shallow, divergence\nSC-08 state after fast-forward" as Store #FEFCE8

cloud "**Remote**\ngit host, teammates, mergers\nbranch protection and\nrequired signing (host)\nSC-09 upstream branch only" as Remote

rectangle "**Release pipeline**\nrelease.yml, pypi environment\nSC-27 signed tag on main\nSC-28 tests and version checks\nSC-29 trusted publishing\nSC-30 tag re-check before release\nSC-31 DCO from main's copy\nSC-38 attested release files, PDF\nSC-39 PDF build: no raw content, no network" as Release #FAF5FF

cloud "**PyPI**\nildan-memforge" as Pypi

Content --> Tools : "read as data, never as code"
Tools --> Content : "writes inside the memory folder,\nno link, no second hard link"
Tools --> Store : "scoped commits;\nverifiedHead only after ff"
Remote --> Store : "**memforge sync**\nfetched objects used only\nafter every commit passes"
Store --> Remote : "git push (user)"
Remote -[dashed,#B91C1C]-> Content : "**git pull / merge / checkout**\nnot verified"
Release --> Pypi : "OIDC upload of the checked commit"
Pypi --> Tools : "pip install"
Content -[dashed,#B91C1C]-> Store : "**.memforge/ signer list change**\nnever in an automatic commit"

note right of Store
**RISK**
* a listed key is trusted completely
* a pin vouches for unchecked history
* hosts enforce registered keys, not the list
* verdicts depend on local git and ssh-keygen
end note

note right of Content
**RISK**
* a trusted signer can write a prompt injection
* the memory folder itself is opened by path
* Windows: a folder swapped mid-open is followed
end note

note right of Release
**RISK**
* environment approval is a repository setting
* a tag moved after the last check is not caught
* trusts GitHub tag verification
* a swapped release file is caught only if checked
* a merged docs change can edit the PDF build itself
end note
@enduml
